TOKEN tinybird_read READ

DESCRIPTION >
    GitHub top-10 referrers and popular paths for public pollinations repos. Each row covers the
    14 days before snapshot_date, so snapshots overlap: compare snapshots, never sum them.
    Query with FINAL to keep the latest fetch per snapshot_date.

SCHEMA >
    `repo` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.repo`,
    `snapshot_date` Date `json:$.snapshot_date`,
    `kind` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.kind`,
    `name` String `json:$.name`,
    `title` String `json:$.title`,
    `count` UInt32 `json:$.count`,
    `uniques` UInt32 `json:$.uniques`,
    `fetched_at` DateTime `json:$.fetched_at`

ENGINE "ReplacingMergeTree"
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY "repo, snapshot_date, kind, name"
ENGINE_VER "fetched_at"
